sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Hannezo, Prost & Joanny (2014) PNAS & Krajnc & Ziherl (2015) PRE 3D epithelial sheet morphology (squamous-to-cuboidal-to-columnar scaling & apico-basal buckling) — MorphoEval overall 53.6/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2016-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d.py` (overall weighted score: 56.4/100). The v1 script implements the Hannezo-Prost-Joanny (2014) 3D incompressible single-cell energy E_cell(A) = (Gamma_a + Gamma_b)*A + c*Gamma_l*V_0/(2*sqrt(A)), equilibrium height h_0, aspect ratio h_0/d_0, and critical buckling wavelength lambda_c = 2*pi*(kappa_eff/K_sub)^(1/4), backed by 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_047_epithelial_buckling_3d.lean`, but relies on a closed-form cosine buckling ansatz instead of L-BFGS-B energy minimization, omits the full 2D (Gamma_l/Gamma_a, K_sub) 5-regime phase diagram and Drosophila comparative tissues, omits E-cadherin knockdown and Myosin-II hyperactivation perturbations, and does not segment the vendored histology specimen (`epithelial_sheet_buckling_specimen.jpg`). Overall 53.6/100 (faithfulness 47.4, reproducibility 67.9); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit e93f00e; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 58, Morphological realism / specimen match 35, Parameter expressivity 49, Morphometric validation 53, Source and data traceability 75, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 62. Output judged: docs/media/epithelial_buckling_3d_comparison.png: rendered output of 2016-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d.py at e93f00e, image/png, 167647 B, 1458×1117 px, artifact_sha256 e5d0e99cc20e4a6ec380a3c440718ab585c303f5100c768bb0fa174f07c45161 (sha256 e5d0e99cc20e4a6ec380a3c440718ab585c303f5100c768bb0fa174f07c45161), spec_fingerprint eabe5855ceb1bf4a12fea7ec7b30902813b84c0440d83d21ca21bb917876b36c. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: eabe5855ceb1bf4a12fea7ec7b30902813b84c0440d83d21ca21bb917876b36c; artifact_sha256: e5d0e99cc20e4a6ec380a3c440718ab585c303f5100c768bb0fa174f07c45161; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/epithelial_buckling_3d/epithelial_buckling_3d_reference.json=eef9f75ed38ce872..., datasets/epithelial_buckling_3d/epithelial_sheet_buckling_specimen.jpg=cd05cc85a7f49dd2..., datasets/epithelial_buckling_3d/paper_citations.bib=e4556865f1879134..., datasets/epithelial_buckling_3d/scout_manifest.json=99741cb299962b18...}." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Evaluate all 12 comparative epithelial tissues across Mus musculus and Drosophila melanogaster with Pearson r, p-value, RMSE, and log-log scaling exponent.",
            "remediation needed: Implement all 5 genetic/mechanical perturbation controls: wild-type buckled columnar folds, E-cadherin knockdown flattening (Gamma_l/Gamma_a depleted -> flat squamous), apical Myosin-II hyperactivation (Gamma_a >> Gamma_b -> apical constriction folding), basal tension hyperactivation (Gamma_b >> Gamma_a -> spontaneous curvature sign reversal), and soft-substrate spherical acinus closure.",
            "remediation needed: Replace the closed-form cosine buckling ansatz with a coupled 3D epithelial cell + substrate bending energy minimizer (L-BFGS-B) across the full 2D phase diagram in (Gamma_l / Gamma_a, K_sub) spanning flat squamous, cuboidal, columnar, buckled folds, and spherical acini.",
            "remediation needed: Segment the vendored CC0 histology micrograph (`epithelial_sheet_buckling_specimen.jpg`) to measure epithelial monolayer height h_0, lateral cell width d_0, aspect ratio h_0/d_0, and fold wavelength lambda_c, and enforce runtime SHA-256 verification." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.536"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 047 Pass 1 Assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

